Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.11,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Cuánto mide el\Nmapa de GTA 6?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:04.44,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Si alguien te da\Nuna cifra exacta,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:05.55,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}sigue leyendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.80,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Rockstar {\c&H33D6FF&}no{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H33D6FF&}ha{\c&HFFFFFF&}\N{\c&H33D6FF&}publicado{\c&HFFFFFF&} ni el
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:09.53,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}mapa completo\Nni su tamaño.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:12.42,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Los mapas que ves por\Ninternet los hacen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:14.85,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}fans, uniendo planos\Nde los tráileres.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.87,0:00:17.86,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Son un trabajo increíble,\Npero son estimaciones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.54,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Lo que sí sabemos:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.39,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}seis regiones, de Vice\NCity a Mount Kalaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:24.93,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}y el escenario más\Nvariado de la saga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:27.55,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Cuando salga, lo\Nmediremos nosotros.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.86,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Sígueme para verlo.
